### 1. Submit one simulation -> 202 Accepted + Location: /api/taxes/orders/{id}
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
]

### 2. Poll the order (repeat until status is COMPLETED or FAILED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/orders/REPLACE-WITH-ORDER-ID

### 3. Read the assessed simulation (simulationUrl from the completed order)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulations/1

### Submit a basket of simulations -> 202 with one order per simulation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/orders/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 15.00, "quantity": 50}
  ],
  [
    {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 10000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 5000},
    {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 5.00,  "quantity": 5000}
  ]
]

### Paginated history (summary)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulations?page=0&size=20

### Sell larger than the portfolio -> 202 now, order ends FAILED after assessment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "buy",  "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100},
  {"operation": "sell", "unit-cost": 20.00, "quantity": 200}
]

### Unknown operation -> 400 Bad Request at submission
POST http://localhost:8080/api/taxes/orders
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"operation": "transfer", "unit-cost": 10.00, "quantity": 100}
]
